[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 103.",
    "start": 1.51,
    "end": 4.222,
    "zh": "第103课。",
    "zh_hant": "第103課。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "The French test.",
    "start": 4.272,
    "end": 5.812,
    "zh": "法语考试。",
    "zh_hant": "法語考試。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 6.873,
    "end": 10.495,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "How long did the exam last?",
    "start": 12.616,
    "end": 15.297,
    "zh": "考试持续了多长时间？",
    "zh_hant": "考試持續了多長時間？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "How was the exam, Richard?",
    "start": 17.598,
    "end": 19.359,
    "zh": "理查德，考试怎么样？",
    "zh_hant": "理查德，考試怎麼樣？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Not too bad.",
    "start": 20.1,
    "end": 21.32,
    "zh": "还不错。",
    "zh_hant": "還不錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "I think I passed in English and Mathematics.",
    "start": 21.66,
    "end": 24.662,
    "zh": "我想我英语和数学都及格了。",
    "zh_hant": "我想我英語和數學都及格了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "The questions were very easy.",
    "start": 24.962,
    "end": 27.683,
    "zh": "问题都很简单。",
    "zh_hant": "問題都很簡單。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "How about you, Gary?",
    "start": 28.123,
    "end": 29.524,
    "zh": "加里，你呢？",
    "zh_hant": "加里，你呢？"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "The English and Maths papers weren't easy enough for me.",
    "start": 30.745,
    "end": 34.166,
    "zh": "英语和数学试卷对我来说不够简单。",
    "zh_hant": "英語和數學試卷對我來說不夠簡單。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "I hope I haven't failed.",
    "start": 34.987,
    "end": 36.647,
    "zh": "我希望我没不及格。",
    "zh_hant": "我希望我沒不及格。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "I think I failed the French paper.",
    "start": 38.128,
    "end": 40.349,
    "zh": "我觉得我法语考试不及格了。",
    "zh_hant": "我覺得我法語考試不及格了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "I could answer sixteen of the questions.",
    "start": 40.91,
    "end": 43.331,
    "zh": "我能回答十六道题。",
    "zh_hant": "我能回答十六道題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "They were very easy.",
    "start": 43.432,
    "end": 44.952,
    "zh": "它们都很容易。",
    "zh_hant": "它們都很容易。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "But I couldn't answer the rest.",
    "start": 45.333,
    "end": 47.454,
    "zh": "但其余的我都答不上来。",
    "zh_hant": "但其餘的我都答不上來。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "They were too difficult for me.",
    "start": 47.755,
    "end": 49.595,
    "zh": "它们对我来说太难了。",
    "zh_hant": "它們對我來說太難了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "French tests are awful, aren't they?",
    "start": 50.636,
    "end": 52.837,
    "zh": "法语考试真糟糕，不是吗？",
    "zh_hant": "法語考試真糟糕，不是嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "I hate them.",
    "start": 53.698,
    "end": 54.719,
    "zh": "我讨厌它们。",
    "zh_hant": "我討厭它們。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "I'm sure I've got a low mark.",
    "start": 55.099,
    "end": 57.02,
    "zh": "我肯定我得分很低。",
    "zh_hant": "我肯定我得分很低。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Oh, cheer up!",
    "start": 57.741,
    "end": 59.201,
    "zh": "哦，振作起来！",
    "zh_hant": "哦，振作起來！"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Perhaps we didn't do too badly.",
    "start": 59.502,
    "end": 61.523,
    "zh": "也许我们考得没那么差。",
    "zh_hant": "也許我們考得沒那麼差。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "The guy next to me wrote his name at the top of the paper.",
    "start": 61.943,
    "end": 65.305,
    "zh": "我旁边那个人在试卷顶部写了自己的名字。",
    "zh_hant": "我旁邊那個人在試卷頂部寫了自己的名字。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Yes?",
    "start": 65.946,
    "end": 66.746,
    "zh": "是吗？",
    "zh_hant": "是嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "Then he sat there and looked at it for three hours!",
    "start": 67.187,
    "end": 70.969,
    "zh": "然后他就坐在那里看了三个小时！",
    "zh_hant": "然後他就坐在那裡看了三個小時！"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "He didn't write a word!",
    "start": 71.109,
    "end": 72.71,
    "zh": "他一个字都没写！",
    "zh_hant": "他一個字都沒寫！"
  }
]
